	"notes": [
		{
			"id": "nKBGU7jgMf0dKej6b",
			"text": "Typical Stats from the package record: ST 14, DX 12, IQ 3, HT 12, HP 14, WILL 8, PER 10, FP 12, SPEED 6, MOVE 6, DODGE 9, DR 2. GCS derives its own values by applying the ancestry; where the two differ, the package's Typical Stats are what the Dungeons on Automatic encounter tables use."
		},
		{
			"id": "niZSuatdojcZsQ9Tg",
			"text": "Encounter rating: CER 18 (offense 10, protection 8), threat tier minor, appearing 2."
		},
		{
			"id": "nN0MXUJbTRHCx8EFI",
			"text": "GCS ancestry draft: gcs/giant-lizard.gct"
		},
		{
			"id": "nd9171qyhKhojrEAk",
			"text": "Independent build total: -46 points of racial traits plus 16 points of racial skills."
		},
		{
			"id": "n-gxmrZMsCInjBAhj",
			"text": "Answers the SRD heading(s): Giant Lizard (SRD 5.1). Only the creature identity is taken from the SRD; the GURPS statistics, ratings and prose are this project's own work and reproduce no SRD text."
		},
		{
			"id": "njpDAdwHSZp1iUS4p",
			"text": "Typical Stats, damage and ratings are derived from the racial template, not authored beside it, so the sheet and the stat block cannot disagree."
		},
		{
			"id": "nTC5ZGzY4guhCFYa2",
			"text": "Body mass used to scale this build: 150 kg. ST, Size Modifier and DR are checked against it; see the gurps-animal-sanity-check skill for the bands."
		},
		{
			"id": "nzFWN5I7zG7XDsxWq",
			"text": "Movement: ground Move 6 (primary). The published Move is the primary medium's cruising Move; sprint figures are stated here and not folded into it."
		},
		{
			"id": "nq2JND8yG7SW1Gn8R",
			"text": "Treasure and grappling are not authored for this batch and ship as explicit nulls; `lair` carries a short habitat note, because where a wandering animal dens is an encounter fact rather than a loot one."
		},
		{
			"id": "nes_OmfvEAGLsOQmT",
			"text": "Three metres nose to tail, which is the SM +1 row."
		},
		{
			"id": "ncDilDiom7Ua53kKl",
			"text": "ST from Basic Lift: it carries a 40 kg carcass up a rock face."
		},
		{
			"id": "nZzf15nRL4yvFcAWz",
			"text": "Added after a post-hoc comparison against independent GURPS fan conversions of this creature: Peripheral Vision; the Tracking skill, which a creature with Discriminatory Smell should always have. The comparison surfaced the gap; the build is still ours."
		},
		{
			"id": "nSuVTfzziy72oF3eY",
			"text": "Monster statistics, ratings and description prose by Monsters on Automatic; AI-generated first draft, project-reviewed, released under CC BY 4.0."
		}
	],
